// Base configuration for the RoomScanStudio app and test targets.
//
// This committed file assigns nothing. An operator who signs builds on their
// own Mac copies Operator.example.xcconfig to the git-ignored
// Operator.local.xcconfig and fills in local values. When that file is absent
// (CI and every unsigned build), the optional include below is silent and the
// project builds unsigned with empty container and privacy-policy settings.
#include? "Operator.local.xcconfig"
